{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9572512f-bd9a-83fa-b9e9-2042bb76d6d1",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T14:33:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diane Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:29:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:29:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. My name is Diane Cardillo. I am calling about the water and sewer bill. I live at 363 Ayrault Street, 363."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:29:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks Diane. What's going on with the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am tenant there. Landlord tell me I owe this water bill. He say it is my bill, tenant pay. But the bill come in his name, I think. So I want to know, whose bill it is? Mine or his?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at the account. Do you have the paper bill in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:30:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have it in my hand. One moment. The bill date is December 12. December 12, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And whose name is printed at the top, under the account number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:30:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Name is the landlord. Not my name. Only his name, and his mailing address is different, not Ayrault Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:30:40-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So the water account is in the property owner's name. The city bills the owner, and the owner is the one responsible to us. Whether a tenant reimburses him is usually something in your lease, between you and him. We can't make that call from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:30:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I do not owe the city. I owe him, maybe, only if lease say so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. The city's bill is his. If your lease says you cover water, then you'd settle that with him directly. I'd check what the lease says."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. But he say pay now, before the weekend. He want the money by Friday. So I want to pay for him, maybe, if lease is yes. How I pay if office is closed? I work in the day, I cannot come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:31:34-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can pay online through the city's website, any time of day. There's also a drop box outside City Hall for checks, and you can pay by phone with the automated line, which runs after hours too. You'll want the account number from the bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online, any time. Okay. And the account number is on the bill, top right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:31:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Top right, yes, usually near the bill date. Just keep in mind, if you pay on his account, the payment goes to his account. Make sure you get something in writing from him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:32:11-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. I will ask him write it. [pause] Sorry, my router is down, my eldest is fixing it now. He is the tech support for our family, so if I lose you, it is the router."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:32:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. If we get cut off, just call back. Anything else on the bill you wanted to check?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:32:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just one more. The amount, it is high for me. But you say this is his bill, so I ask him. Not my problem today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If he has questions about the charges, he can call us with the account number, and we'll go through the usage with him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:32:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I tell him call you. So, online, any time, before Friday. Friday, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:33:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Online will post right away, so you'd be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:33:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you, Priya. That is what I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:33:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Diane. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:33:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
